<P2para>
<Text>This Order may be cited as the Immigration (Passenger Transit Visa) (Amendment) (No. 2) Order 2023.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2023/980/article/1/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2023/980/article/1/2" id="article-1-2">
